# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Vite's transient bundled-config artifacts (`vite.config.ts.timestamp-*.mjs`).
# Vite writes one per config load and they are pure build debris, but they land
# in the source tree next to vite.config.ts, so without this rule a `git add -A`
# sweeps one into a commit.
vite.config.ts.timestamp-*.mjs

